docs {
  # Get Inventory Detail By ID

  This request is used to get inventory details and reminders by the given inventory's `id`. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Name | Type   | Required | Description  | Example                               |
  |------|--------|----------|---------------|-----------------------------------------|
  | id   | string | yes      | Inventory ID | 09397f65-211e-3598-2fa5-b50cdba5183c   |

  ## Responses

  **200 — Inventory details fetched successfully**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "inventory fetched",
    "data": {
      "id": "83ce75db-4016-d87c-2c3c-db1e222d0001",
      "inventory_name": "Stand Bracket Laptop",
      "inventory_category": "Office Tools",
      "inventory_desc": "Stand 2 laptop dan hp",
      "inventory_merk": "A Merk",
      "inventory_room": "Main Room",
      "inventory_storage": "Desk",
      "inventory_rack": null,
      "inventory_price": 28200,
      "inventory_image": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/gudangku-94edc.appspot.com/o/inventory%2F2d98f524-de02-11ed-b5ea-0242ac120002_flazefy%2Fdbc22192-f630-4c68-8a95-d148de537bde?alt=media&token=ac5e7d97-9711-4f4e-b22e-4ff911cf6006",
      "inventory_unit": "Pcs",
      "inventory_vol": 1,
      "inventory_capacity_unit": null,
      "inventory_capacity_vol": null,
      "inventory_color": null,
      "is_favorite": 0,
      "is_reminder": 0,
      "created_at": "2024-03-14 02:28:37",
      "created_by": "2d98f524-de02-11ed-b5ea-0242ac120002",
      "updated_at": "2024-10-25 09:37:20",
      "deleted_at": null
    },
    "reminder": [
      {
        "id": "26c0092a-5013-2a81-3a36-fc0abeb7ce6e",
        "reminder_desc": "Clean using hand sanitizer and micellar water",
        "reminder_type": "Every Month",
        "reminder_context": "Every 1",
        "created_at": "2024-07-16T00:06:05.000000Z"
      }
    ]
  }
```

  **401 — Authorization token required**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — Inventory not found**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "inventory not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}